test "rank1656: a fingerprint cache with no owner column is not a principal mapping"
  lang python
  file _template_cache.py
  reject VYQL-AUTH-083
  code
  ```
  from sqlalchemy import Column, Integer, Text
  from sqlalchemy.orm import declarative_base

  Base = declarative_base()


  class TemplateFingerprint(Base):
      __tablename__ = 'template_fingerprints'
      fingerprint = Column('Fingerprint', Text)
      template = Column('Template', Text)
  ```
